  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yehu, mosinto o Hanani, rigakwana mamincha ya Baasa, rigateeba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nigo nakoimokereretie igoro korwa ase orotu, ngakobeeka okaba omoraai bw’abaanto baane Abaisraeli, na bono aye kwabwatirie chinchera chia Yeroboamu, naende kwagerire abanto baane Abaisraeli bakorire ebibe na bangechirie goika nabeire nendamwamu ase engencho y’ebibe biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ningosirie kegima, aye Baasa amo nabaanto b’enyomba yao ebe buna enyomba ya Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi ore bw’enyomba ya Baasa orakwere ase omochie ime, chisese nachimorie, na onde bwensi orakwere isiko aarabu, chinyoni chia igoro nachimorie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Baasa, na aya onsi akorete, na okobua kwaye, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasa akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete agatindekwa agwo Tirisa, na Ela omwana oye omomura akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo ring’ana ri’Omonene rikarentwa nomobani Yehu, mosinto o Hanani, igoro ya Baasa na abanto b’enyomba yaye, ase engencho y’amabe onsi akorete ase amaiso ’Omonene. Omonene akagechigwa goika akaba nendamwamu ase engencho y’ayio onsi Baasa akorete ase okoba buna abanto b’enyomba ya Yeroboamu; boigo ekiagera asiretie abanto abwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ela omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo ebere na etano nomo bw’okogaamba gw’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Ela, mosinto o Baasa, agachaaka kogaambera Abaisraeli agwo Tirisa, akagaamba emiaka ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omosomba oye Simuri, omochiki bw’ekeng’ese gie chigari chiaye, agakora omooroberio bw’okomoita. Ekero Ela arenge agwo Tirisa okonywa na gotinda ase enyomba y’Arisa, oria otenenerete enyomba y’oborwoti aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuri agasoa nyomba, akamoaka, akamoiyeria inse na komoita. Ayio igo akorete ase omwaka bw’emerongo ebere, na etano na ebere, bw’okogaamba gw’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda. Magega y’ayio Simuri akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero achagete kogamba, ase obwango boria ere ebegete omonyene goikaransa ase ekerogo ki’oborwoti, agaita abanto bonsi b’enyomba ya Baasa, tatigaretie omonto omosacha nonya noyomo ase eamate yaye gose ase abasani baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Simuri agasiria kegima enyomba yonsi ya Baasa, koreng’ana buna ring’ana riri’Omonene akwanete mamincha ya Baasa goetera ase Yehu omobani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nigo akoregete ase engencho y’ebibe bionsi bia Baasa, na ebia Ela, omwana oye. Barabwo bakagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe bikagechia Omonene Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, erinde akaba nendamwamu ase engencho y’emegwekano yabo bagosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Ela, na aya onsi akorete, nigo ariikire ime ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simuri omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo ebere, na etano na ebere, bw’okogaamba gw’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Simuri akagaamba ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere agwo Tirisa. Emeganda y’esegi egatoora korwania Gibetoni, omochie bw’Abafilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria batoorete aria bakaigwa ng’a Simuri okorire omooroberio bw’ogoita omorwoti. Ase ayio, ekero Abaisraeli bonsi baarenge ase egetwori ase rituko riria bakabeeka Omuri, omochiki bw’emeganda y’esegi, akaba omorwoti obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Omuri akaimoka korwa Gibetoni amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi, bakagenda koboera Tirisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Simuri aroche ng’a omochie obwatirwe, agasoa ase eburi y’enyomba y’omorwoti, agasamba enyomba y’omorwoti, na Simuri omonyene agesamberao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio igo akoregete ase engencho y’ebibe akorete ase obosio bw’Omonene, ase okobwatia chinchera chia Yeroboamu, na ase ebibe akorete akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Simuri, na omooroberio bw’ogoita akorete, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuri omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Abaisraeli bagaatananeka chinsemo ibere, ekeng’ese ki’abaanto bagatunyana Tibuni, mosinto o Ginati, baganetie komobeeka abe omorwoti, na ekeng’ese kende bagatunyana Omuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abatunyanete Omuri bakabua abanto batunyanete Tibuni, mosinto o Ginati; na ekero Tibuni akuure, Omuri akaba omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato nomo bw’okogaamba gw’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Omuri agachaaka kogaambera Abaisraeli, akagaamba emiaka ikomi na ebere; akagaamba agwo Tirisa ase engaki y’emiaka etano nomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagora egetunwa gia Samaria korwa ase Semeri ase rigori rie chitalanta ibere chi’echifeta, akaagacha omochie igoro yaye, akayogitera chindwaki, Akaaroka omochie oria aagachete Samaria, erieta ria Semeri, oyio orenge omonyene egetunwa keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri agakora amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, agakora amabe goetania baria baarengeo ritang’ani riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo abwatetie chinchera chia Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, agakora ebibe buna ebiaye, boigo akagera Abaisraeli bakabikora. Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, akagechigwa, akaba nendamwamu ase engencho y’emegwekano yabo bagosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Omuri akorete, na okobua okwo aorogetie, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete agatindekwa agwo Samaria, na Ahabu, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato, na gatano na gatato bw’okogaamba gw’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Ahabu, mosinto bw’Omuri, agachaaka kogaambera Abaisraeli, agwo Samaria; ere akagaamba emiaka emerongo ebere na ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu, mosinto bw’Omuri, agakora amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene goetania bonsi abamotang’anerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akarora ng’a namang’ana amagusu kobwatia chingencho chia Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, na agakora ebibe buna ebiaye; amo nayio akanyuoma Yesebeli, omoiseke bw’Etabali, omorwoti bw’Abasidoni. Boigo agakorera enyasae Baali na koyesasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatenenia egesasiimero kia Baali ime ase enyomba ya Baali, eria aagachete agwo Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu akaroisia omote bw’Asera, enyasae enkuungu; agakora bobe mono goetania abarwoti bonsi baria bamotang’anerete, akagechia Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, goika akaba nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko ’okogaamba kwaye, Hieli o Beteli akaagacha Yeriko. Ekero abegete oboroso bw’omochie oyio, Abiiramu omwana oye omomura omotangi, agakwa; naende ekero atenenetie ebiita, Segubu, omwana oye omomura omokogoti, agakwa. Ayio igo akoregete koreng’ana ne ring’ana ri’Omonene, riria riakwanetwe na Yoshua, mosinto o Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
